<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer starts Amoco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer starts Amoco.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Bruce Lanni started Amoco Corp with a market perform rating, said Asit Sen, a fellow analyst at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage set earnings estimates for the 1996 year of $4.70 per share and $4.80 per share for 1997, Sen said.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1730</p>
